<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Etulo</book>
  <para style="h">2 Emi iTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Afɛ mgbi iPol ongwu fan mbi ama onoyɛyɛ Emi iTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Emi iTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2EiTe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Afɛ mgbi iPol ongwu fan<optbreak/> mbi ama onoyɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Emi iTesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Afɛ nɛ kyɛ mbi ani iPol, iSaila bɛyi iTimoti, le kɛ mbi emi odzimgbasho mi iTesalonika, ema nli mgbi Imgbasho Otseyi bɛyi Otsɛ iYesu iKrestu nani.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Ni elela bɛyi iyu mgbi Imgbasho Otseyi bɛyi Otsɛ iYesu iKrestu dzɛ yi ema.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Angba otaata bɛyi ibɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Dzɛ mbisɔ eyi ka ta Imgbasho angba alonɔ mi ikye mgbi ema, emi ongwuneyi, ma li ngha yɛyɛ, ikyesinɛ oyɛyɛ mgbi ema le sheeshe lu iyayi, okpitukwu mgbi ema mbi ewema kpaa le sheeshe. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Nghanɛ, mi idzidzɛ okwakye mgbi emi iKrestu duu eyi li tsaabɔ igɛgɛ ikye ema mi itukwu oshiishi bɛyi oyɛyɛ onuunu mi isɔ yi ali imbadi ngwi ema to le nyɛ mi ele duu.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Ungwɔ ntonɛ duu li ambɛ otso gbɛɛ ikwɔ ogbɔɔgbɔ mgbi Imgbasho li ayin, ikyenghanɛ ema ka mɛ okaka esutɔ mgbi Imgbasho, ongwu ema le gyadzɛ ikyen nɛni. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Mi ikwɔ mgbi Imgbasho ofwoofwo, o ka oyile mkpa adzɛ kpa ama nle nu ema adzɛ ntonani. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>O dika nu ama a le nu ma isɔ nɛ tonya bɛyi eyi kpaa. Ungwɔnɛ ka kyɔ mi onɔ ngwi Otsɛ iYesu ka kyɛ esho yi angbodzi engyesɔ mgban mi amoola mani. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>O ka kwo ama n ye Imgbasho ba di noyɛyɛ mi Esɔ Osuse mgbi Otsɛ mgbi eyi iYesu ba ntona adɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>A ka kwo ma adɔ yi odzili-dzili igyegwu, a dika ba inai Otsɛ bɛyi mfye mgban okwɔkwɔ ba <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>mi egbe ngwi o ka ba owa gbɛ okwɔkwɔ mbi inggisɛ mgban ama osaan bɛyi otsɛɛtsɛ mbi ama onoyɛyɛ duu mani. Ema kpaa ka wele yi ama, ikyesinɛ ema noyɛyɛ mi obwɛndɛ mgbi eyi mbi ema.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Ikyenghanɛ, eyi bibɔ tonya ba ikye ema, gbɛɛ ni Imgbasho nu ema mɛ ela okwuukwu mgban, odi nu ali oweka mgbi ema osuse duu bɛyi ali idɔ mgbi oyɛyɛ onuunu mbwumbwo mi mfye mgban. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Mi itɔ ofɛ nɛ iyi mgbi Otsɛ iYesu mgbi eyi ka tu okwɔkwɔ ikpewo ema, ongwu kpaa dika nu ema okwɔkwɔ, mi elela mgbi Imgbasho mgbi eyi bɛyi Otsɛ iYesu iKrestu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Inggisɛ imbaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Mi ikye odzɛ oyɛɛyɛ mgbi Otsɛ mgbi eyi iYesu iKrestu, bɛyi owa gbe eyi kwakye mbonyi yan nɛ, ani tɛkyɛ nu ema emi ongwunani gbɛɛ, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>ka wɛndɛ hona kye itukwu feesho ba na. Odzɛ ama ogbɛɛsɛ atsika gbɔ yi esɔ ema fwo hona afɛ ngwi a lɔ nu ema gbɛɛ, egbe mgbi Otsɛ teyi ba wa na, kyɛ mbi eyi ba. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Ka nu inggisɛ onyi kpaa kpagya ema wo mi ofɛ onyonyi ba, lubana egbe na ka ba ba sede inggisɛ ibyibyi ka kye afɔ twɛsɛ yi elodzimgbasho, a dika kye inggisɛ imbaali ongwu a kyon dzɛ ikye owa dzilin na tsɔɔnɔ se. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>O ka fwa di kyile ewon esho ngha alungwɔ a li kwun di Imgbasho bɛyi ungwɔ a li sunu duu, jo o ka kye ewon tuo mi ozu okwukwo osunu Imgbasho mi iJerosalin, le tekpo gbɛɛ ongwu li Imgbasho.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Ema wɛ dafi onɔ ngwi ani ka dzɛ yi ema ma ani li nya ema ungwɔ ntonɛ baa? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Onɛnɛ ema di ye ungwɔ nkwu inggisɛ imbaali na kwulɛsɛ mani, ikye ni a wa kyon tso mi onɔ ma yɛyɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Lubana mfye odaada mgbi inggisɛ imbaali na teyi le kyidɔ wa; kpaa ongwu nbwan kwulɛsɛ onɛnɛ nɛ ka kiyayi okyɔ ngha nghataa mbisɔ a kawa dulun tɔ mi ofɛ nani. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Ta a kawa kye ongwu nli ngyo ola ba na dɔ ododa, nghaduu Otsɛ iYesu ka kyi gbɛlun mfye mi mmyɛ ongwi ondu mgbi ongwu di dzilin mi okwɔkwɔ mgbi obaaba mgbi ongwu mani. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Ongwu nli ngyo ola ba na ka ba yi mfye mgbi iSatan di wa kyɔ ali ambɛ ikpaflo bɛyi ungwɔ ama okwulewo duu, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>dika kye ali itɔ ofɛ ibwubwe duu okpagya ama nkawa dzili ma wo. A ka dzili ikyekyɛ a fwa ogbɛ Esɔ Osuse nɛ yi atsa adzi ni a dulu ma watɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Ikyenghanɛ Imgbasho kye onodzi owɛndɛ ofyumfye nu ma ikyegbɛɛ nu ma noyɛyɛ mi atsika, <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>adzi ni ama nnoyɛyɛ mi otsitsi ba kpaa gbela yi imbaali ma gyobube.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwudzɛ kpɔklɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Nghaduu i tishi ngwi eyi kile ta Imgbasho angba alonɔ mi ikye ema, emi ongwuneyi ama nkpa Imgbasho itukwu, ikyesinɛ mi owita-wita ma Imgbasho sadu ema ikyegbɛɛ ni ema watɔ mi idɔ mgbi Onodzi Osaan ngwi a kyi salu ema bɛyi ikye oyɛyɛ onuunu mi otsitsi nani. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>O kwu ema ela nyɛ mi Esɔ Osuse ngwi eyi le gbɔ nɛni, ikyegbɛɛ ni ema tu okwɔkwɔ mgbi Otsɛ mgbi eyi iYesu iKrestu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Nghanɛ, emi ongwunani, kwudzɛ kpɔklɔɔ na di kye abɔ byi mi otsootso ngwi eyi tso ema nɛni, ki no li mi odzɛ ondu naadi mi afɛ olɔɔlɔ kpaa.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Ni Otsɛ mgbi eyi iYesu iKrestu abuon bɛyi Imgbasho Otseyi, ngwu eyi kpan itukwu bɛyi mi elela mgban nu eyi ɛwɛ okwuwo igyegwu bɛyi eka ogbe byiibyi osuse, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>kwu ewema ɛwɛ wo di fyumfye mi itukwu na mi ali idɔ osuse bɛyi odzɛ ogbɔɔgbɔ duu.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Bibɔ ikye eyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Ongyɛɛngyɛ yɔ, emi ongwunani, bibɔ ikye eyi adzi ni esɔ mgbi Otsɛ gbɔfwɛ plɛ-plɛ di dzɛ yi mmwɛ, dafi i dzɛ yi ema nose mani. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Di bibɔ na gbɛɛ nu ma dulu eyi mi abɔ emi imbaali bɛyi emi ibwubwe, lubana li inggisɛ tsatsa dzɛ yi oyɛyɛ onuunu ba. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Nghaduu Otsɛ li ndu ba, o dika nu ema mfye di ngyo ema mi abɔ ibwubwe inggisɛ nani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ibwubwe inggisɛ: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na li iSatan.</char></note> <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Eyi dzɛ yi abɔ otsigɛgɛ mbi Otsɛ gbɛɛ ema le ngyo dika kiyayi okyungwɔ ngwi eyi wo ema ola nani. <verse eid="2TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Ni Otsɛ kye ema itukwu byi okpitukwu mgbi Imgbasho bɛyi itukwu oshiishi mgbi iKrestu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adɔ okwookwo mi ikye emi ewewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Mi iyi mgbi Otsɛ iYesu iKrestu, eyi wo ema emi ongwuneyi ola gbɛɛ, ni ema dzɛ mbombo yi ali emi ongwunema ama nli kyidɔ ba di dzɛ mi otsootso ngwi ema gbɛ mbi eyi ba duu. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Lubana ema abuema ye dafi ema ka kyɛdɔ ambɛ mgbi okyɔɔkyɔ mgbi eyi. Eyi li ama odzɛ abɔ ayayi mi onɔ ngwi eyi dzɛ yi ema ma ba, <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>hona eyi gye ungwogye mbi inggisɛ onyi mi ayayi ba. Mi ayɛ oka yɔ, eyi li kyidɔ otu yi onɔ, le gyadzɛ dile kwunewo ikyegbɛɛ ni eyi ka li okye mbi inggisɛ onyonyi ba. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Eyi kyungwɔnɛ, ikyegbɛɛ di eyi dzɛ yi ofɛ ngwi a ka ya eyi abɔ ba ba, nghaduu li ikye onu eyi li ambɛ ngwi ema ka kyɛdɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Lubana onɔ ngwi eyi dzɛ yi ema ma kpaa, eyi wo ema ola nɛ gbɛɛ, &lt;&lt;Kini inggisɛ ka kyidɔ bayɔ, non ka gye ungwogye ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Eyi fwo gbɛɛ angbeka mi idzidzɛ ema li emi okwulo. A li gbela okyidɔ ba; sede okye ondu wo inggisɛ ewo. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Li itɔ inggisɛ ntona ngwi eyi le gbɔ yi ama dile wo ma ola mbi Otsɛ iYesu iKrestu gbɛɛ, nu ma yile igɛgɛ bɛsɛ di kyidɔ otu ungwogye ngwi a ka gye.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Nghaduu mbi ema, emi ongwunani yɔ, ka yama ndɛ okyɔ osuse ba.<verse eid="2TH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Kini inggisɛ fwa ofwo odzɛ owɛɛwɛ ngwi eyi lɔ mi afɛ nɛ yɔ, kye ɛwɛ byin saan na, dzɛ enggengga yan, adzi ni ayiwi kwun. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Kpaa ka kyen dafi inggisɛ ikyili mgbi ema ba, nghaduu kwon adɔ dafi ongwunɔ mani.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elodzɛ ongwi olɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Ani bibɔ gbɛɛ ni Otsɛ Imgbasho mgbi iyu abuon nu ema iyu alonɔ bɛyi mi ali ofɛ duu. Otsɛ no dzɛ yi ema duu.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Ani, iPol, lɔ angba nɛ mi abɔ mgbi ani, nli ambɛ otso idzidza mi afɛ ngwi ani lɔ duu. Ikye otso gbɛɛ li ani iPol lɔ.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Elela mgbi Otsɛ mgbi eyi iYesu iKrestu no dzɛ yi ema duu. No dzɛ ngha.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
